   "bbox": [
    110.4,
    35.9,
    531.1,
    51.1
   ],
   "text": "tuna fishing trip, during which the vessel operated up to 52 nautical miles west of Gold",
   "conf": 0.9959,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    111.2,
    51.1,
    267.8,
    63.1
   ],
   "text": "Beach, OR in the Pacific Ocean.",
   "conf": 0.979,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    110.4,
    77.8,
    498.0,
    91.4
   ],
   "text": "4.1.2. At 1830, UNA MAS began its transit back with the Operator at the helm",
   "conf": 0.9924,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    111.2,
    93.0,
    514.4,
    105.0
   ],
   "text": "reported to be utilizing the auto-pilot feature but with manual capability to adjust as",
   "conf": 0.9958,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    109.6,
    105.0,
    519.2,
    119.8
   ],
   "text": "necessary, with C-1 sitting behind the Operator and C-2 sitting across from C-1. The",
   "conf": 0.9935,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    110.4,
    119.0,
    512.8,
    133.7
   ],
   "text": "seating arrangement was not fully enclosed, and all occupants were exposed and/or",
   "conf": 0.9996,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    110.4,
    133.3,
    520.8,
    147.3
   ],
   "text": "partially exposed to open air. The fish tote storage was full, with 01 tote on each side",
   "conf": 0.9954,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    110.4,
    146.9,
    537.5,
    160.9
   ],
   "text": "behind the seating area, 01 ice chest in between captain's chair and opposite seat, and 01",
   "conf": 0.9941,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    111.2,
    161.7,
    311.6,
    173.6
   ],
   "text": "Reliable kill bag forward of ice the chest.",
   "conf": 0.9984,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    110.8,
    188.4,
    512.8,
    201.6
   ],
   "text": "4.1.3. At 2004, C-1 took a video on the UNA MAS as they transited in. The video",
   "conf": 0.9915,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    110.8,
    202.8,
    529.1,
    216.0
   ],
   "text": "shows the sunset, C-2 wearing a mustang collar life jacket sitting across from C-1, and",
   "conf": 0.9908,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    110.4,
    216.0,
    535.9,
    230.3
   ],
   "text": "part of the back of the vessel with the port fish tote. The vessel was maintaining a plane.",
   "conf": 0.9969,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    110.8,
    243.9,
    518.8,
    257.1
   ],
   "text": "4.1.4. At 2015, C-1 and C-2 called their spouses to check-in. No concerns reported.",
   "conf": 0.9946,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    110.4,
    271.1,
    538.3,
    284.6
   ],
   "text": "4.1.5. At 2020, the Operator slowed or bumped the throttle on the UNA MAS to a slow",
   "conf": 0.9865,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    110.0,
    284.6,
    512.8,
    299.4
   ],
   "text": "speed. Slow speed was reported uncomfortable in the weather conditions. Operator",
   "conf": 0.9943,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    110.4,
    298.6,
    525.1,
    313.0
   ],
   "text": "brought UNA MAS back up to a plane, approximately 18-22 knots, with the autopilot",
   "conf": 0.9919,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    110.4,
    312.6,
    177.7,
    327.3
   ],
   "text": "still engaged.",
   "conf": 0.9999,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    110.8,
    340.5,
    522.0,
    353.7
   ],
   "text": "4.1.6. At 2039, while transiting a swell, the UNA MAS experienced a port side first",
   "conf": 0.9957,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    110.4,
    354.1,
    527.9,
    367.7
   ],
   "text": "descend. Concurrently, the starboard tote behind C-1’s seating area, became dislodged",
   "conf": 0.9947,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    110.4,
    368.1,
    361.0,
    381.6
   ],
   "text": "from its securing strap and rapidly migrated to port.",
   "conf": 0.9923,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    110.0,
    394.8,
    534.7,
    409.6
   ],
   "text": "4.1.7. At 2040, the UNA MAS experienced a capsizing incident, rolling to port, which",
   "conf": 0.9957,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    111.2,
    410.4,
    366.6,
    422.3
   ],
   "text": "caused the Operator, C-1, and C-2 to enter the water.",
